   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The idea is that…",
     "texto": [
      "To explain the content of an idea, a quoted sentence is nominalised: present-tense verbs use **-ㄴ/는다는 것**, adjectives **-다는 것**, and past forms **-았/었다는 것**.",
      "문제는 버스가 늦게 **온다는 거예요** = the problem is that the bus comes late. 그 소식이 사실**이라는 거예요** = the idea is that that news is true."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Not the same as -는 것",
     "texto": [
      "**버스가 늦게 오는 것** names the fact that the bus arrives late; **버스가 늦게 온다는 것** presents the proposition «the bus arrives late». With **문제는/이유는/중요한 점은** the idea being explained is introduced.",
      "이유는 어제 버스가 늦게 **왔다는 거예요** = the reason is that yesterday the bus came late."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
